{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"何西阿書","commonName":"何西阿書","title":"何西阿書","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"c837f467a020938eec4ea2e106f9662e4fc510f07ebe6c3afbf22ab35e3647fb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":196},"chapter":{"number":7,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"我想醫治以色列的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮的罪孽和撒馬利亞的罪惡就顯露出來。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們行事虛謊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"內有賊人入室偷竊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"外有強盜成群騷擾。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們心裏並不思想我記念他們的一切惡；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們所行的現在纏繞他們，都在我面前。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["宮廷內亂"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"他們行惡使君王歡喜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"說謊使首領喜樂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們都是行淫的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像火爐被烤餅的燒熱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從摶麵到發麵的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"暫不使火着旺。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我們王宴樂的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"首領因酒的烈性成病；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"王與褻慢人拉手。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"首領埋伏的時候，心中熱如火爐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就如烤餅的整夜睡臥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到了早晨火氣炎炎。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾民也熱如火爐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"燒滅他們的官長。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的君王都仆倒而死；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們中間無一人求告我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列和列邦"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"以法蓮與列邦人攙雜；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮是沒有翻過的餅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"外邦人吞吃他勞力得來的，他卻不知道；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"頭髮斑白，他也不覺得。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的驕傲當面見證自己，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖遭遇這一切，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們仍不歸向耶和華－他們的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不尋求他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮好像鴿子愚蠢無知；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們求告埃及，投奔亞述。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們去的時候，我必將我的網撒在他們身上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要打下他們，如同空中的鳥。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必按他們會眾所聽見的懲罰他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們因離棄我，必定有禍；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因違背我，必被毀滅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我雖要救贖他們，他們卻向我說謊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"他們並不誠心哀求我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"乃在床上呼號；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們為求五穀新酒聚集，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仍然悖逆我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我雖教導他們，堅固他們的膀臂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們竟圖謀抗拒我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們歸向，卻不歸向至上者；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們如同翻背的弓。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的首領必因舌頭的狂傲倒在刀下；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這在埃及地必作人的譏笑。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/7.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/8.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/6.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}